{"success":true,"code":null,"message":null,"requestId":"T4cb745eae1f84de881a576b6d23f2d66","data":{"contentData":{"id":"RAW_15f1fd36","displayDocument":"<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5be40496&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FQDzjsr2LzB4iamdaLmU2GnvIeIibUS3DYjP2PHGhh7ibPOwKwk3paVL6Jj05YCsJBnZM8g8iciaicOB9oRwB3F5wzEcmNbCgGSFSXdWH8EMhm4C14%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></p>\n  <p><span>今天恒生互联网暴涨4.7%，美团大涨9.27%还算情理之中，因为昨晚公布的季报减亏近百亿，外卖内卷有止战的迹象。但更重要的是腾讯今天爆了，几万亿的公司一天涨10.46%，巨阳柱撑起了中概股的天。</span></p>\n  <p><span>腾讯之所以有这么炸裂的表现，源自英国《金融时报》在北京时间6:15发布的独家消息，称即将在中国最大的聊天软件上线ai助手。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5a01a03b&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FQDzjsr2LzB4kWZ4T2Ee3rmq3xAIicobtJQH4Q4gHRAdFEpIxZqNthaXU2zufCzxiaYAPtLxO1A5xYNo6m7RewxHdncjhNNLvCznhqOK4wcT8c%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p><span>报道里说消息源自2位腾讯知情人士，豆包模型增长太快，给了腾讯巨大压力，集团以最高战略推动在微信上添加ai工具的项目。目前已经有早期demo演示，可以在微信主屏幕上向右滑动访问ai聊天框，ai背后链接数以万计的小程序，彻底串联起微信全生态。</span></p>\n  <p><span>目前还没有具体上线时间，腾讯计划会分批灰度用户测试，一旦全面铺开会产生巨额算力费用，目前不好说腾讯是否能产生足够收入来覆盖这笔新增成本，暗指可能会影响短期业绩。</span></p>\n  <p><span>报道里还说腾讯之前ai战略过于保守，没有在美国禁令前囤积足够的英伟达芯片，国内算力供应不足，所以后续大规模部署所需的算力是个巨大挑战。</span></p>\n  <p><span>这篇报道出来后国内媒体大规模转发，然后市场情绪就爆了，普遍认为14亿的微信用户会让腾讯冲回国内ai赛道的领先位置，不过10%的巨阳柱还是有些过于激动，感觉也有报复惩罚前段时间阴跌砸盘的人的意思。</span></p>\n  <p><span>恒生互联网板块里的另一位阿里今天也大涨6.6%，逻辑也是差不多的，美团在外卖上投入少了，阿里肯定也会相应减少，京东亦然。同时阿里的ai模型在国内也是一线水平，跟着反弹也不意外。</span></p>\n  <p><span>今天反弹完恒生互联网2026年依然下跌18%，明明都是中国最好的一批互联网企业，股价跌成这个鬼样子，堪比a股的白酒了。</span></p>\n  <p><span>……</span></p>\n  <p><span>给大家介绍一个<a class=\"weapp_text_link js_weapp_entry\" style=\"\">红色火箭小程序</a>上的用户福利，也是老朋友了。</span></p>\n  <p><span>他们是华夏基金做的一个指数查询工具，全免费的，最近上线了一个福利活动，只要你从红色火箭平台上进入ETF会员中心进行过人脸识别认证，他们会自动查询你所有账户里持有华夏系ETF基金的份额，根据他们的积分机制认证伙伴等级，然后每个月会都有福利。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=db06c0a8&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FQDzjsr2LzB7bicKWI5ggia7UcQudlWZ40Gl4CJ0X6CgH3vKIiaQCxE9sfUNmicu1WkxddNZc8HNeC4FsH28KAhTx8woupdiblicvfKkuHA8picOQNY%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p><span>可能有读者看了表格会撇撇嘴，买几十万上百万，每个月就领这三瓜两枣的还不够覆盖价格风险的。对，你如果专门为了这点福利买基金那你就是个棒槌，但如果你本来就已经有华夏基金的ETF，【顺便】每个月领这些福利，白嫖的香不香？</span></p>\n  <p><span>再多说一层，其实要凑华夏基金的份额办法也蛮多的，他们家有各种etf，直接搜“ETF华夏”从中挑选就可以，只要有心平替一下就能堆积额度。我之前因为就持有华夏的ETF，已经符合资格每月领上福利了。</span></p>\n  <p><span>再再再多说一层，债券基金、货币基金ETF也算有效额度，你们就琢磨吧，最终你会发现要达成铂金甚至钻石没那么难。</span></p>\n  <p><span>还是那句话，你不必为了领福利去凑数买基金，但如果你已经有基金了，这福利你还不是顺手就领了。点击下面的图片就能去认证页面。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"weapp_image_link js_weapp_entry\" style=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=88c8768f&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FQDzjsr2LzB6JB5lUCNuicJmCFWToDzqWJI9U2Jug5LQPiajjxHcGjnd0e0DuwB2G66GfH1MthH9iaKvHic6FzfedTsrQhcUSoGs07fkJSIoA38Y%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></a></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>……</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>连续暴跌2天的ai板块今天反弹，元件+3.86%、光模块+3.48%、通信设备+2.62%，算是稳住了阵脚，资金又开始虹吸，别的板块就扑街了。今天指数普红，但是市场中位数下跌了1.44%，72%的个股今天是绿的。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>你们说散户还如何能心平气和的看待这次的结构化牛市，敢情在缺乏增量资金，并且国家队上半年还撤退了5000-6000亿的情况下，助推ai牛市的资金有很大一部分是从传统行业这里吸过去的。小登们赚的钱就是老登们亏的钱，这样的存量博弈就是让散户斗散户，所以现在股票论坛经常撕逼吵架，戾气很重。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>很多人都在暗暗诅咒ai崩盘，但行业还在高速增长的景气周期，短时间内没看到衰竭的迹象。欧美韩台的大厂现在订单都做不过来，还在加大扩产能，谷歌计划进行800亿美元的股权融资，用户扩建ai基础设施和算力，原因是目前已经无法满足ai需求。这800亿里伯克希尔认购了100亿。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>海力士计划5年内将晶圆产能翻倍，他们的高管认为存储芯片的产能瓶颈会持续到2030年，就算他们是卖家，对周期判断过于乐观，但比较谨慎的机构也认为2028年之前供给缺口会一直存在。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>行业里面最大的两家明星公司，openai和anthropic都还没上市，从节奏上说这波ai行情不会提前结束。这两公司的估值都近万亿，产业资本对周期是有更专业的判断的，如果他们觉得6月份就强弩之末的话，他们会抓紧在2-3月份就上市的。现如今两家公司的ipo窗口都安排在9-10月，那就是说美国那边认为ai周期大概率能持续到年底，甚至更久。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>我觉得像这种大势与其听野路子股神掐指算命，还不如看看产业资本主力军的动向更靠谱一些。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>……</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>1、黄仁勋说英伟达加深和迈威尔公司的合作，他们会是下一个万亿公司，迈威尔股价暴</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\">涨21%，目前总市值2300亿美元。这公司是做芯片设计的，光模块DSP全球双寡头之一，是中继续创和新易盛的上游供货商，中继续创50%都是从迈威尔那里采购的。我知道股票名字有错别字，输入法自己出来的，我懒得改，你们能看懂就行。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;font-style:normal;\">2、东方证券的黄燕铭今天有个观点传播的很广，他说地产圈的有钱人挣了会消费，会享乐，但是科技从业者挣了钱只会去加班，正好现在全社会主流财富都向科技行业集中，所以消费不看好。有点道理，在支配财富的态度上两代人确实不太一样。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>写到这惊闻魏宗万老师逝世了，享年89岁，客观来说算高寿。他有好多角色我真的很喜欢，老三国司马懿，老水浒高俅，三毛从军记里的老鬼，还有投名状里短短几个镜头就演的出神入化，演啥像啥，真正的表演艺术家。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=423f315a&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FQDzjsr2LzB7icGG05KOZ69UK6MPibqnF3w5hPVS0d2ZCOBibiamzu8aibTOiaVSz9nAm7j6jYvUdtqMUqkwVzAv4FuxfIXPCKNRyVkje3hg58Yoj8%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>魏老师，走好。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;letter-spacing:0.544px;clear:both;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>最后感谢昨天支持稿费的7万多位读者，互联网上体面都是读者给的，我会稳定上钟，勤力更新的。</span></p>\n  <